Cell["\<\
On a curve the centres lie at equal arclength. A circle gives a cycle, a \
zigzag a path:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4698d780-0473-44fb-9978-d1048c0af078"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
